KnotC: a companion CSOK.*_hit_ws lemma (the WScoped conjunct, with its own grind_pattern) after
each _hit lemma: vcgen splits a conjunction post into one VC per conjunct since lean4#15487
(vendor/README.md, "Toolchain switch" 3).

diff --git a/vendor/con-leche/ConLeche/Verify/Cached/KnotC.lean b/vendor/con-leche/ConLeche/Verify/Cached/KnotC.lean
